# A play session for the owner at the first dungeon's boss, on R4's build
# (docs/NATIVE_R4.md): PPFX's commands bypassed and its output rendered
# natively, in blocks of 5 s alternating with R3's dual run
# (DOTHEROES_PPFX_BYPASS=alt:300): in the R3 blocks the existing renderer
# draws PPFX and the native renderer's output is compared with it (every
# frame's final composite, every draw of every 30th frame and after a
# change); in the R4 blocks what is shown is the native renderer's, handed
# back to the engine, every 30th handback read back on both sides and
# compared. What it adds to R4's coverage: the boss fight's own
# post-processing and any magic attack's, which no automated route reaches.
#   SCENARIO=owner_boss_r4 build/venv/Scripts/python.exe tests/boot_smoke.py
# needs R4's development build in build/r4/play (copied from build/r1/bld
# by the R4 checkpoint). A fresh copy of checkpoint dungeon1-boss-door each
# run (CONTINUE starts at the dungeon's door; the special key is in the room
# north of the north room), normal damage, sound, fullscreen. The results
# go to the run's ppfx_report.txt (build/sessions/boot-<time>-<tag>/; the
# first differing outputs in ppfx_dump/), the saves the game writes to
# build/checkpoints/owner-boss-r4/. If anything looks wrong -- a flicker
# every 5 s, a missing effect -- press F8 (or L3+R3) at that moment: the
# mark goes into the run's log with its time.
#! saves build/checkpoints/dungeon1-boss-door
#! env BIN=build/r4/play/dotheroes.exe RUNS_IN=build/sessions KEEP_RUNS=1000 PREEMPT_TESTS=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PPFX_NATIVE=1 DOTHEROES_PPFX_BYPASS=alt:300 DOTHEROES_PPFX_HANDBACK_CHECK=30
#! env DOTHEROES_PPFX_REPORT=ppfx_report.txt DOTHEROES_PPFX_DUMP=ppfx_dump
#! env DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1 DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1
#! env WINDOW=1 PS3RECOMP_VK_FULLSCREEN=1 AUDIO=1 PS3_OSD_FPS=2 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0 PS3_VERBOSE=0
#! env DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_RECORD=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log
#! env PS3RECOMP_SPIRV_CACHE=build/play-boss/cache DOTHEROES_FPS=display
#! secs 14400
until_exit build/checkpoints/owner-boss-r4
